{"PageNumber":381,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":45,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَقَدۡ أَرۡسَلۡنَآ إِلَىٰ ثَمُودَ أَخَاهُمۡ صَٰلِحًا أَنِ ٱعۡبُدُواْ ٱللَّهَ فَإِذَا هُمۡ فَرِيقَانِ يَخۡتَصِمُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> أَرْسَلْن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَىٰ ثَمُودَ أَخَاهُمْ صَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِحًا أَنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>عْبُدُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ فَإِذَا هُمْ فَرِيقَانِ يَخْتَصِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٥</span>","End":"٤٥","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":46,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ يَٰقَوۡمِ لِمَ تَسۡتَعۡجِلُونَ بِٱلسَّيِّئَةِ قَبۡلَ ٱلۡحَسَنَةِۖ لَوۡلَا تَسۡتَغۡفِرُونَ ٱللَّهَ لَعَلَّكُمۡ تُرۡحَمُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>قَوْمِ لِمَ تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّيِّئَةِ قَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَسَنَةِ‌ۖ لَوْلَا تَسْتَغْفِرُونَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُرْحَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٦</span>","End":"٤٦","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":47,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ ٱطَّيَّرۡنَا بِكَ وَبِمَن مَّعَكَۚ قَالَ طَـٰٓئِرُكُمۡ عِندَ ٱللَّهِۖ بَلۡ أَنتُمۡ قَوۡمٞ تُفۡتَنُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>طَّيَّرْنَا بِكَ وَبِم<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن م</tajweed>َّعَكَ‌ۚ قَالَ طَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ئِرُكُمْ عِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ند</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ‌ۖ بَلْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ قَوْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>مٌ ت</tajweed>ُفْتَن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٧</span>","End":"٤٧","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":48,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَكَانَ فِي ٱلۡمَدِينَةِ تِسۡعَةُ رَهۡطٖ يُفۡسِدُونَ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَلَا يُصۡلِحُونَ","TajweedText":"وَكَانَ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَدِينَةِ تِسْعَةُ رَهْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>طٍ ي</tajweed>ُفْسِدُونَ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ وَلَا يُصْلِح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٨</span>","End":"٤٨","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":49,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ تَقَاسَمُواْ بِٱللَّهِ لَنُبَيِّتَنَّهُۥ وَأَهۡلَهُۥ ثُمَّ لَنَقُولَنَّ لِوَلِيِّهِۦ مَا شَهِدۡنَا مَهۡلِكَ أَهۡلِهِۦ وَإِنَّا لَصَٰدِقُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> تَقَاسَمُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ لَنُبَيِّتَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> وَأَهْلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ لَنَقُولَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ لِوَلِيِّه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> مَا شَهِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>نَا مَهْلِكَ أَهْلِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا لَصَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>دِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٩</span>","End":"٤٩","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":50,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَكَرُواْ مَكۡرٗا وَمَكَرۡنَا مَكۡرٗا وَهُمۡ لَا يَشۡعُرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَمَكَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مَكْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رًا و</tajweed>َمَكَرْنَا مَكْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رًا و</tajweed>َهُمْ لَا يَشْعُر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٠</span>","End":"٥٠","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":51,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَٱنظُرۡ كَيۡفَ كَانَ عَٰقِبَةُ مَكۡرِهِمۡ أَنَّا دَمَّرۡنَٰهُمۡ وَقَوۡمَهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","TajweedText":"فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>ُرْ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>قِبَةُ مَكْرِهِمْ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا دَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َرْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ وَقَوْمَهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥١</span>","End":"٥١","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":52,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَتِلۡكَ بُيُوتُهُمۡ خَاوِيَةَۢ بِمَا ظَلَمُوٓاْۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗ لِّقَوۡمٖ يَعۡلَمُونَ","TajweedText":"فَتِلْكَ بُيُوتُهُمْ خَاوِيَ<tajweed class=iqlab>ةَۢ ب</tajweed>ِمَا ظَلَم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed>‌ۗ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ فِى ذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ لَأَيَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةً ل</tajweed>ِّقَوْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٍ ي</tajweed>َعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٢</span>","End":"٥٢","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":53,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَنجَيۡنَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَكَانُواْ يَتَّقُونَ","TajweedText":"وَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نج</tajweed>َيْنَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> وَكَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> يَتَّق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٣</span>","End":"٥٣","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":54,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلُوطًا إِذۡ قَالَ لِقَوۡمِهِۦٓ أَتَأۡتُونَ ٱلۡفَٰحِشَةَ وَأَنتُمۡ تُبۡصِرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلُوطًا إِذْ قَالَ لِقَوْمِه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِۦٓ</tajweed> أَتَأْتُونَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْفَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>حِشَةَ وَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ تُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>صِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٤</span>","End":"٥٤","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":55,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَئِنَّكُمۡ لَتَأۡتُونَ ٱلرِّجَالَ شَهۡوَةٗ مِّن دُونِ ٱلنِّسَآءِۚ بَلۡ أَنتُمۡ قَوۡمٞ تَجۡهَلُونَ","TajweedText":"أَئِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمْ لَتَأْتُونَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رِّجَالَ شَهْوَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن د</tajweed>ُونِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>ِس<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ‌ۚ بَلْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ قَوْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>مٌ ت</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>هَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٥</span>","End":"٥٥","PageNumber":381,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":152,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false}]}